 Shortly before the release of GTA 6 , an email allegedly sent by a professor in Spain went viral, informing students that they would be given more time to play.
 The message surfaced on X on November 16 , stating that there would be no assignments or deadlines in his class during the game's launch week. Furthermore, an exam scheduled for November 23 was moved to the 30th of the month.
